          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p><strong>\"Compact and dependable\"</strong></p><p>The battery holds up great even with high-frequency updates. It fits easily into small spaces, making it perfect for tracking gear while traveling.</p>",
            "author": "Michael L.",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "1644818997c04c6254-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p><strong>\"Small size, big performance\"</strong></p><p>It is barely the size of a matchbox and very easy to hide. Setup was fast, and the custom boundary alerts on my phone give me great peace of mind</p>",
            "author": "Sarah L.",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "1644818997c04c6254-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p><strong>\"Survived muddy trails\"</strong></p><p>Strapped this to my bike frame, and it got completely covered in grime and water. It still works flawlessly. This device is truly built for harsh environments.</p>",
            "author": "David R.",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        }
